From c2a7d3efff5e7e7c13d7d1e400646fbf13c4d8a7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pbs05 <27010143+pbs05@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 18:58:06 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: add AN7581 PON data and control paths

Add the GDM2 PON netdev with GEM/T-CONT/LLID classification, multi-GEM
flow tables, and shared QDMA data-path counters.

Transport OMCI and OAM through dedicated control netdevs while the Ethernet driver owns QDMA, DMA, IRQ and NAPI.

Signed-off-by: pbs05 <27010143+pbs05@users.noreply.github.com>
